docs {
Canary CI/CD - memverifikasi deploy baru tanpa DB dan tanpa auth.
Field `runtime` membuktikan entry yang melayani: "node" (dev / Deno /
Render) atau "cloudflare-workers" (tier 1). Field `host` memilah
tier 2 dari tier 3 karena keduanya `runtime: node`. Envelope standar
Section 13.

200 sukses:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "pong": true,
        "time": "2026-09-17T14:22:21.458Z",
        "env": "production",
        "runtime": "cloudflare-workers",
        "host": "api.sambasku.com"
      }
    }
}

meta {
  name: Ping (Canary)
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ping
  body: none
  auth: none
}

tests {
  test("200 + pong + runtime + host teridentifikasi", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.pong).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.runtime).to.be.oneOf(['node', 'cloudflare-workers']);
    expect(res.body.data.env).to.be.a('string');
    expect(res.body.data.host).to.be.a('string');
    expect(res.body.data.host.length).to.be.greaterThan(0);
  });
}
